  "description": "<div>\r\n<div data-testid=\"conversation-turn-37\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p><strong>Payment Terms:</strong></p>\r\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p>We accept major credit and debit cards, including Visa, MasterCard, American Express, and Discover.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>For added convenience, we also accept payments via popular online payment platforms such as PayPal.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>All payments are processed securely to protect your financial information.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Other Information:</strong></p>\r\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Shipping:</strong> We offer various shipping options, including standard and expedited shipping. Shipping fees are calculated based on your location and the weight of your order.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Return Policy:</strong> Our return policy allows for returns within 30 days of receiving your order, provided the items are unused and in their original condition.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Customer Support:</strong> Our dedicated customer support team is available to assist you with any inquiries or concerns. Contact us at admin@relaxroyaldesigns.com.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Newsletter:</strong> Stay updated with our latest arrivals, promotions, and fashion tips by subscribing to our newsletter. Follow us on social media for daily style inspiration.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>At Relax Royal Designs, we are passionate about fashion and dedicated to providing an exceptional shopping experience. Thank you for choosing us as your fashion partner.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><br><br></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><form>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div data-projection-id=\"63\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</form></div>",
